#!/bin/bash
#
# CheckMK plugin to verify certbot operations.
#
# Purpose:
# - Validate that certbot CAN renew each domain (challenge works), independent of expiry.
# - Domain discovery via `certbot certificates` (handles multiple names per cert).
# - If a domain fails the dry-run, print the domain name and a one-line error for CheckMK.
#
# If certbot is already running in parallel we need to
# take care of by trying again after a random amount of time.
#
# Let this check run every 24 hours as such put the file into
# /usr/lib/check_mk_agent/plugins/86400
#
# This file is part of Check_MK.
# The official homepage is at http://mathias-kettner.de/check_mk.
